  "description": "High-signal, embedded-aware Pigweed code review skill with strict comment calibration. Dispatches the enabled language reviewer subagents in parallel (one patch each), merges their findings into one calibrated verdict, and falls back to an inline audit for files with no enabled reviewer. Supports both Self-Review Gate mode (pre-upload verification for /crank) and Gerrit CL Reviewer mode (staging calibrated --draft comments via ./gh pr comment). Do not load for a quick LGTM or a single-file look, and not for /respond-style comment handling (see .agents/skills/respond/SKILL.md).",
